## Authority flow (E1–E2)

```text
dtcg/platform.primitives.tokens.json
        │
        ▼
generate-dtcg-primitives.mjs ──► src/primitives.css (@generated, F4)
        │
dtcg/platform.semantics.tokens.json
        │
        ▼
generate-dtcg-semantics.mjs  ──► src/semantics.css (@generated, F5)
        │
dtcg/platform.tokens.json
        │
        ▼
generate-dtcg-theme.mjs  ──► src/themes/light.css (@generated)
        │
dtcg/platform.dark.tokens.json
        │
        ▼
generate-dtcg-theme.mjs  ──► src/themes/dark.css (@generated)
        │                 operator-admin-dark-semantics.css (@generated, F6 — admin .dark cascade)
        │
dtcg/workspaces/<id>.tokens.json  (starter · guest-club · urban · denali)
        │
        ▼
generate-workspace-dtcg-css.mjs ──► packages/workspaces/<id>/theme/tokens.css (@generated)
        │                         theme/marketing/semantic-tokens.css (@generated, E4)
        │                         theme/portal-semantic-tokens.css (@generated, E4)
        │                         theme/admin-semantic-tokens.css (@generated, F1 — blocks[])
        │                         theme/wizard-semantic-tokens.css (@generated, F3)
        │
        ▼
generate-tokens.mjs      ──► src/generated/*.ts
```

## Semantic map (platform light)

| DTCG path | CSS variable | Notes |
| --------- | ------------ | ----- |
| `color.primary` | `--color-primary` | Brand primary |
| `color.primary-hover` | `--color-primary-hover` | |
| `color.primary-fg` | `--color-primary-fg` | |
| `color.accent` | `--color-accent` | CTA accent — **not** `--color-warning` |
| `color.accent-fg` | `--color-accent-fg` | |
| `color.bg-page` | `--color-bg-page` | |
| `color.warning` | `--color-warning` | Status semantic (may match accent value on platform default) |
| `focus.ring-color` | `--focus-ring-color` | |

Rule: DTCG path segments join with `-` and prefix `--` (`color.text-primary` → `--color-text-primary`).

## Guards

| Guard | Role |
| ----- | ---- |
| `guard-dtcg-tokens` | Schema + required keys in platform light/dark + all workspace slices |
| `guard-dtcg-css-sync` | Runs `generate-dtcg-primitives.mjs`, `generate-dtcg-semantics.mjs`, `generate-dtcg-theme.mjs`, `generate-workspace-dtcg-css.mjs` `--check` (no drift) |
| `guard-dtcg-hex-ban` | DTCG outputs `@generated`; skin hooks + `marketing/shell.css` + `marketing/components/*.css` + `admin-skin.css` must not contain raw `#` hex |
| `dtcg-light-generation.spec.mjs` | Unit: accent maps to `--color-accent`, light file is `@generated` |
| `dtcg-dark-generation.spec.mjs` | Unit: dark shadows/accent, starter tokens `var(--color-primary)` only |
| `dtcg-e3-workspace-slices.spec.mjs` | Unit: guest-club / urban / denali slices → committed `tokens.css` |
| `dtcg-e4-skin-semantic.spec.mjs` | Unit: marketing/portal semantic slices → `@generated` CSS; hook files hex-free |
| `dtcg-e5-marketing-components.spec.mjs` | Unit: denali `mkt.*` tokens; shell + components have no raw `#` hex |
| `dtcg-f1-admin-skin.spec.mjs` | Unit: `denali.admin.tokens.json` blocks → `admin-semantic-tokens.css`; `admin-skin.css` hex-free |
| `dtcg-f2-admin-hooks.spec.mjs` | Unit: finance + wizard shell hooks hex-free; calendar aliases semantic vars |
| `dtcg-f3-wizard-fields.spec.mjs` | Unit: `denali.wizard.tokens.json` → `wizard-semantic-tokens.css`; `wizard-fields.css` hex-free |
| `dtcg-f4-primitives.spec.mjs` | Unit: `platform.primitives.tokens.json` → `primitives.css`; denali motion/wizard partial hooks hex-free |
| `dtcg-f5-semantics.spec.mjs` | Unit: `platform.semantics.tokens.json` → `semantics.css`; interactions hook hex-free |
| `dtcg-f6-admin-appearance.spec.mjs` | Unit: admin dark semantics from `platform.dark`; `operator-admin-appearance.css` hook-only |
| `guard-admin-feature-appearance-ast` | AST: admin feature TSX `className` — no palette scale colors or `#` arbitrary values (F7) |
| `guard-denali-admin-dark-primary` | F9-2: Denali admin dark `--color-primary` is `#5eead4`, not platform `#5b9fd4`; triple cascade arm present |
| `admin-feature-appearance-ast.spec.ts` | Unit: F7 scan passes on `patterns/`, `dashboard/`, `onboarding/` |
| `dtcg-f9-admin-dark-primary.spec.mjs` | Unit: F9-2 DTCG dark block + semantic CSS primary isolation |

Reference syntax: `{color.primary}` → `var(--color-primary)`; `{flat.focus-ring-color}` → `var(--focus-ring-color)` (flat group emits unprefixed shadcn aliases).

| Workspace | `ws.color-accent` value | Generated CSS |
| --------- | ----------------------- | ------------- |
| `starter` | `{color.primary}` | `var(--color-primary)` |
| `urban` | `{color.primary}` | `var(--color-primary)` |
| `denali` | `{color.primary}` | `var(--color-primary)` |
| `guest-club` | `#2563eb` (scaffold brand) | literal hex in `@generated` file only |

## Workspace DTCG slices (E3)

Hand-authored skin files **must not** contain `#` hex literals. Color semantics live in DTCG slices:

| DTCG slice | Generated output | Hand-authored hook |
| ---------- | ---------------- | ------------------ |
| `<id>.marketing.tokens.json` | `theme/marketing/semantic-tokens.css` | `theme/marketing/tokens.css` — `@import` + layout/`var()` aliases only |
| `<id>.portal.tokens.json` | `theme/portal-semantic-tokens.css` | `<id>-portal.css` — `@import` + layout hooks only |
| `<id>.tokens.json` | `theme/tokens.css` | (none — full file generated) |

`rgba()` / `color-mix()` in layout shadows remain allowed in hook files until a later motion/elevation DTCG schema exists.

## Marketing component hook contract (E5)

| File class | Hex policy |
| ---------- | ---------- |
| `marketing/semantic-tokens.css` | `@generated` — hex allowed in DTCG output only |
| `marketing/tokens.css` | hook — `var()` / layout only (E4) |
| `marketing/shell.css` | hook — no `#` hex; overlay colors via `--mkt-*` from DTCG |
| `marketing/components/*.css` | hook — no `#` hex; reference semantic/`--mkt-*` vars |

Denali overlay palette (`--mkt-on-overlay`, `--mkt-overlay-icon`, `--mkt-hero-ink`, `--mkt-mask-ink`, accent/destructive shades) lives in `denali.marketing.tokens.json` → `semantic-tokens.css`.

## Admin skin hook contract (F1)

| DTCG slice | Generated output | Hand-authored hook |
| ---------- | ---------------- | ------------------ |
| `<id>.admin.tokens.json` | `theme/admin-semantic-tokens.css` | `admin-skin.css` — `@import` + layout hooks only |

Admin semantic slices use a **`blocks[]`** array — each block has its own `scopeSelector` (light body scope + dark triple cascade). Token groups per block: `denali.*` brand palette, `color.*` platform semantics, `flat.*` shadcn aliases (`flat` → unprefixed `--primary`, `--sidebar-*`, etc.).

Denali F1 scope: `denali.admin.tokens.json` → `admin-semantic-tokens.css`; `admin-skin.css` imports semantic layer and wires operator sidebar, empty states, bookings inbox, focus rings via `var()` / `color-mix()` only.

## Admin hook hex ban (F2)

Finance + wizard **shell** hooks reference admin semantic vars only — no raw `#` hex:

| Hook file | Hex policy | Semantic source |
| --------- | ---------- | --------------- |
| `finance-skin.css` | `var()` / `color-mix()` only | `--color-*`, `--denali-*` from `admin-semantic-tokens.css` |
| `wizard-skin.css` | same | dark wizard re-bind uses inherited `var(--color-primary)` (admin DTCG) |
| `wizard-calendar.css` | same | `--denali-wizard-calendar-*` aliases `--color-primary*` |
| `wizard-fields.css` | `var()` / `color-mix()` only | `--wiz-tone-*` from `wizard-semantic-tokens.css` |

## Wizard fields hook contract (F3)

| DTCG slice | Generated output | Hand-authored hook |
| ---------- | ---------------- | ------------------ |
| `<id>.wizard.tokens.json` | `theme/wizard-semantic-tokens.css` | `wizard-fields.css` — `@import` + layout/`color-mix()` hooks only |

`wiz.tone.*` groups define swatch source/fg pairs (forest, sky, purple, orange, amber, rose, emerald) plus dark variants. Gear picker uses `wiz.tone.sky.fg-gear` where fg differs from theme picker.

## Platform primitives (F4)

| DTCG slice | Generated output | Notes |
| ---------- | ---------------- | ----- |
| `platform.primitives.tokens.json` | `src/primitives.css` | `@generated` — space, radius, typography, layout, shadow, z-index |

`rgba()` shadows remain in DTCG output only (not in hand-authored hooks).

## Platform semantics (F5)

| DTCG slice | Generated output | Notes |
| ---------- | ---------------- | ----- |
| `platform.semantics.tokens.json` | `src/semantics.css` | `@generated` — component aliases (`--color-surface`, `--color-border`, …) reference theme vars |

## Operator admin appearance (F6)

| Output | Source | Hand-authored hook |
| ------ | ------ | ------------------ |
| `operator-admin-dark-semantics.css` | `platform.dark.tokens.json` (`.dark` cascade selectors) | — |
| `operator-admin-appearance.css` | — | wizard platform shell + validation hooks; `@import` dark semantics; inline body reset |

Dark palette duplication between `themes/dark.css` (`.theme-dark`) and admin file removed — both generated from the same DTCG slice with different selectors.

