## F7 — Admin feature appearance AST (palette ban)

**Scope:** `apps/web/src/admin/{patterns,dashboard,onboarding}/**/*.tsx` — **not** shell (I0 already covers `operator-shell.tsx`, `operator-header.tsx`, `operator-nav.tsx`, `operator-account-menu.tsx`).

**Contract:** feature TSX may use **semantic** shadcn/Tailwind tokens (`text-muted-foreground`, `bg-primary`, `border-border/50`, `text-destructive`, …) and layout utilities (`flex`, `gap-*`, `truncate`, …). **Forbidden** in `className`:

| Class pattern | Example | Why |
| ------------- | ------- | --- |
| Tailwind palette scale | `bg-red-500`, `text-slate-600` | bypasses DTCG semantic vars |
| Raw named colors | `bg-white`, `text-black` | use `*-foreground` / `bg-background` |
| Arbitrary hex | `bg-[#1e5a8e]` | hex belongs in DTCG `@generated` CSS only |

**Guard:** `node scripts/guards/guard-admin-feature-appearance-ast.mjs` (also in `admin-control-pack`).

**F8 (done):** all 17 feature TSX purged to `data-*` hooks — see § F8 below. Non-purged files no longer exist under scan dirs.

